        "bodyHtml": "Cho'Gath ravenously feeds on an enemy, dealing <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(300/475/650 + (50% Ability Power) + (10% bonus Health)) true damage</span> to champions or <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(1200 + (50% Ability Power) + (10% bonus Health))</span> to minions or jungle monsters. If this kills the target, Cho'Gath gains a stack, which causes him to grow in size and gain <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">80/120/160 max Health</span>. Only 6 stacks can be gained from minions and non-epic jungle monsters.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Current minion and non-epic jungle monster stacks:</span> <span>?/6</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Cho'Gath gains bonus attack and <span>Feast</span> cast range based upon his stacks:<br />4.7/6.2/7.7 Attack Range per stack (max 75).<br />2.5 Cast Range per stack (max 25).</span>",
